    {
      "id": "claim_d63143deb27b41b2a5e51825ab242941",
      "statement": ".github/workflows/deploy.yml is triggered by pushing a v*.*.* tag. It verifies the tag exists on origin, that HEAD matches the tag commit, and that the tag commit is reachable from origin/main; verifies GitHub Environment 'production' protection (deployment tag policy) fails closed if the check is inconclusive; builds and pushes the image to GHCR; mirrors the GHCR digest into the Fly registry as an immutable image; stages required secrets to Fly before deploying; polls GET /ok until ready; and runs a deployed smoke test with tracing off. Smoke failure fails the deployment and there is no automatic rollback.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.github/workflows/deploy.yml#L1-L90",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:420c77370cfad046d699ea70c920bf4d1fed1be069e49b40ffff20703f61f29f:"
