      "statement": "`make release TAG=vX.Y.Z` and `make rollback TAG=vX.Y.Z REASON='why'` and `make release-digest TAG=vX.Y.Z` are hermetic local previews only (validate/print, or resolve a digest); none of them dispatch a workflow or push/mutate anything remotely.",
