      "statement": "release.yml pushes the release tag using a RELEASE_TAG_TOKEN PAT rather than the default GITHUB_TOKEN, because refs pushed with GITHUB_TOKEN do not raise workflow-triggering events and a tag created with it would never trigger deploy.yml; the job refuses to create the tag if RELEASE_TAG_TOKEN is unset rather than produce a silently-dead tag. A successful run pushes an annotated tag whose message is the generated release notes and publishes a corresponding GitHub release.",
