    {
      "id": "claim_4eceac1b6cf64bfeb28afbd675fc9c16",
      "statement": "The rollback job never rebuilds an image: it checks out the target release tag (pairing that tag's deploy/fly.prod.toml with its image), verifies the tag exists on origin and is reachable from origin/main, resolves the released {{version}} GHCR tag to a digest (or accepts the break-glass digest override), and deploys that digest with flyctl using --config deploy/fly.prod.toml checked out at the target tag — checking out the target tag is what prevents deploying an old image against a newer TOML.",
