    {
      "id": "claim_9ab67068683c4ed9a34c512784b45c45",
      "statement": "Several deployment facts are described in docs/deploy.md and the Fly TOML comments but are not asserted by any hermetic CI test, because they depend on live infrastructure state that hermetic tests cannot observe: the actual Postgres cluster provisioning and its 2026-08-24 sign-off, whether GitHub Environment 'production' protection rules are currently configured as deploy.yml expects at runtime (the workflow re-checks and fails closed on every run, but no hermetic test pins the environment's live configuration), whether all required Fly/GitHub secrets are actually seeded, and whether the member stream perimeter v2 frontend build matches the server's flipped value at any given deployed instant.",
      "evidence": [
